# Layer normalization over the last axis composes public operations, so each
# result holds the values its operations read from the results before it.
# Forward returns xhat * gamma + beta with xhat = (x - mean) * deviation and
# deviation = 1 / sqrt(mean((x - mean)^2) + epsilon), the means along the
# last axis.
