# Forward of x of a nonempty shape whose last extent is the extent of gamma
# and beta, each a tiled tensor of its contract, with the views that stretch
# the shape, the shape with the last extent 1 and [features] to the shape: the
# output holds xhat * gamma + beta, xhat and the deviation hold their
# values, and gamma and beta return as they were given.
